  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase Out HCFC Management Plan Phase II will seek to reduce HCFC consumption by 65% of the countrys baseline. The project will seek to promote good refrigeration practices, and the enforcement of the licensing and quota system which will reduce the amount of HCFC-22 used for refrigeration servicing.</narrative>
